# 9. QR PASS SECURITY

Implement HMAC-SHA256.

The token must contain:

- Pass ID.
- Server-generated HMAC signature.

The signature must incorporate immutable pass details and expiry information.

Verification must:

- Retrieve the pass from the database.
- Reconstruct the expected signature.
- Use `hmac.compare_digest`.
- Confirm parent consent is YES.
- Confirm warden decision is APPROVED.
- Confirm the pass is not expired.
- Confirm the pass has not already been used.
- Reject altered tokens.
- Reject revoked or rejected passes.

Only the backend can generate signatures.

The frontend only displays the QR code.

